# Gradle / build output
.gradle/
build/
app/build/
captures/
*.apk
*.aab
# Delivery tarballs: `git archive` output handed to the owner each release,
# because the GitHub push is blocked. A snapshot of the repo does not belong
# inside the repo.
CyOpsTD-*-source.tar.gz
*.ap_
*.dex

# Local SDK location, signing material and Play/AdMob configuration.
#
# `secrets.properties` is where the AdMob ids and the upload key's password
# live. The repository's own `gradle.properties` is TRACKED and holds build
# settings only -- putting a secret there commits it, which is why there is a
# separate file with an obvious name.
local.properties
secrets.properties
keystore.properties
keystore/
*.jks
*.keystore

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store

# Logs
*.log

# Kotlin 2.x build session scratch
.kotlin/
# Rendered audio previews sent for review; the generated tracks come from code.
*.wav
# ...but res/raw is shipped resources, not previews. The boot chime is a file
# the owner supplied and the app loads by resource id, so excluding it does not
# make the build smaller, it makes the build fail — on CI and on any fresh
# clone, with "Unresolved reference 'boot_chime'".
!app/src/main/res/raw/*.wav
